@startuml US_3_1_5_Cenario
title US 3.1.5 - Páginas/formulários autorizados

actor User as "System User (role)"
participant SPA as "SPA Page (ex.: VesselVisitNotificationsComponent)"
participant Guard as "AuthGuard"
participant API as "TodoApi"
database DB as "Port DB"

User -> SPA: Clicar menu "Visit Notifications"
Guard -> Guard: Check data.roles (admin/authority/agent)
Guard --> SPA: allow or redirect (Access Denied toast)
SPA -> API: GET /api/VesselVisitNotifications (list)
API --> DB: query with role checks
DB --> API: results
API --> SPA: JSON list
SPA -> User: tabela com filtros/busca
User -> SPA: preenche formulário create/update
SPA -> API: POST/PUT /api/VesselVisitNotifications
API --> User: 201/204 ou 4xx com erros
SPA -> User: feedback conforme US 3.1.4

@enduml
